# Deployment archives built for upload
*.zip

# Database dumps and fixtures.
# `salon_data_backup.json` was tracked and contained real customer bookings,
# a contact message, auth.User rows including the admin password hash, and
# session records. Nothing produced by `dumpdata` against a live database
# belongs in the repository -- use `manage.py backup`, which writes to
# `backups/` (already ignored above).
salon_data_backup.json
*_data_backup.json
*_backup.json
dumpdata*.json
